{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03358",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 4.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.01,
      "end_seconds": 9.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Right, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.39,
      "end_seconds": 22.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "It's sudden severe pain in the lower tummy. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.05,
      "end_seconds": 24.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.21,
      "end_seconds": 28.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.85,
      "end_seconds": 33.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Alright, how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.25,
      "end_seconds": 40.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.19,
      "end_seconds": 43.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.43,
      "end_seconds": 51.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "It usually comes with shoulder tip pain. With shoulder tip pain, it just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.6,
      "end_seconds": 57.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "And what about fever, discharge or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.77,
      "end_seconds": 61.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "No fever, discharge or vomiting, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.86,
      "end_seconds": 66.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.64,
      "end_seconds": 70.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Well, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.86,
      "end_seconds": 73.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.7,
      "end_seconds": 76.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.15,
      "end_seconds": 90.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.87,
      "end_seconds": 93.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.01,
      "end_seconds": 97.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.81,
      "end_seconds": 102.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.5,
      "end_seconds": 108.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.66,
      "end_seconds": 116.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.52,
      "end_seconds": 119.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.15,
      "end_seconds": 122.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.24,
      "end_seconds": 126.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.78,
      "end_seconds": 131.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.63,
      "end_seconds": 150.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.1,
      "end_seconds": 153.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.74,
      "end_seconds": 158.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.16,
      "end_seconds": 161.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.93,
      "end_seconds": 185.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.02,
      "end_seconds": 198.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.24,
      "end_seconds": 218.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.0 degrees, pulse 109, blood pressure 100 over 64."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.2,
      "end_seconds": 221.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.5,
      "end_seconds": 227.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.83,
      "end_seconds": 232.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.58,
      "end_seconds": 236.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.21,
      "end_seconds": 260.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "You are pale and clammy with a rigid, tender tummy and a very low blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.53,
      "end_seconds": 276.29,
      "duration_seconds": 12.76,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Putting it all together, I don't have a clear answer today: a ruptured ectopic pregnancy is possible, and so is a ruptured ovarian cyst."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.34,
      "end_seconds": 279.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.79,
      "end_seconds": 291.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a ruptured ectopic pregnancy do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.34,
      "end_seconds": 316.76,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "Let's book a pregnancy test to look into collapse. We should do urgent blood tests for internal bleeding. I am calling the emergency team, you need an operation now. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.94,
      "end_seconds": 318.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.57,
      "end_seconds": 336.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.48,
      "text": "Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Book a review straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.62,
      "end_seconds": 341.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}